      },
      "lineNbr": 12,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-09-23T06:39:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you crash, because of this, then you know where you crashed and this trace will not help with that.\n\nWhat exactly is this code supposed to be used for?  Just bring-up of a driver?  Why does this need to be on a shipping device?",
      "parentUuid": "65e7ba73_8abd9730",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "4756a690db616045f3d5325139227193e91d6547",
