      "writtenOn": "2020-09-23T00:23:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have kept \"default y\" because of GKI. Google GKI image can provide the tracpoints and vendor modules can register.\n\nFrom vendor side, we will have two flavors of build. \n1) perf build where no vendor module registers with these trace points.\n2) debug build, where one of the vendor module registers and logs into uncached memory area. \n\nBut for the above two use cases, Google GKI image is common. So there won\u0027t be any performance hit in the 1) case.",
      "parentUuid": "473e90b8_2b245af3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 87,
        "endChar": 10
